# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile COPYs. Everything else
# stays out, notably secrets (.env, .env.oracle, cookies.txt), local venvs and caches.
# A new COPY of a path not listed here fails the build loudly instead of silently
# shipping something. Keep this in sync with the Dockerfile's COPY lines.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!main.py
!cli.py
!knowledger/
!tests/
!scripts/

# Stale bytecode from a local run could shadow the copied source inside the image.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
